    {
      "id": "gh_secrets_sync",
      "name": "同步Git Secrets",
      "keys": [
        "github_pat",
        "github_repo"
      ],
      "author": "許諾",
      "repo": "https://github.com/Crack22/loon-plugins",
      "icons": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Crack22/loon-plugins/main/icons/gh-secrets.jpg"
      ],
      "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Crack22/loon-plugins/main/loon-gh-sync/github_secrets_sync.js",
      "descs_html": [
        "把 BoxJs 里的签到账号传到 GitHub 仓库的 Secrets 里，GitHub Actions 每天 09:00 自动签到，不用挂梯子，手机关机也能签。本地 Loon 插件保持不变，两边同时跑，先签到的那个生效。",
        "先创建一个 Token：<a href=\"https://github.com/settings/tokens?type=beta\">点这里创建 Fine-grained Token</a>，选 Only select repositories → loon-plugins，Repository permissions 里 Secrets 选 Read and write，然后把 Token 粘贴到下面的「GitHub Token」。",
